# The central menu routes to every surface; here it opens Usage.
# Walking to the row shows the menu's whole list on the way there.
Output docs/media/menu.gif
Source demo/tapes/common.tape

Sleep 1s
Ctrl+B
Sleep 200ms
Space
Sleep 2.2s
Type@450ms "jjjjjj"
Sleep 1.2s
Enter
Sleep 4.5s
Escape
Sleep 800ms
